  245:     `metadata/<group>/<artifact>/index.json` file and the dynamic-access coverage
  247:   - `latest/metrics-over-time.svg` and `latest/metrics-over-time-dark.svg` — light and dark historical charts referenced from [COVERAGE.md](../../COVERAGE.md).
